{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06739","headline":"秋山寄陈谠言 · 王昌龄","name":"秋山寄陈谠言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩间寒事早，衆山木已黄。\n北风何萧萧，兹夕露爲霜。\n感激未能寐，中宵时慨慷。\n黄虫初悲鸣，玄鸟去我梁。\n独卧时易晚，离羣情更伤。\n思君若不及，鸿雁今南翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}